  "proven_findings": [
    "All nine BTP rows contain the same sets as BTS but no Winner field.",
    "All nine completion confirmations were sent by the simulator in the older run starting 2026-11-05T17:06:30Z. For each matching trace the stored server log records the exact result write failing with no-result roughly five seconds later.",
    "None of the nine BTS rows currently has btp_needsync=true. Eight also lack the local winner; 269 retains a local winner.",
    "The normal fetch path does not resend pending results. pushall is called after LOGIN and selects only rows marked btp_needsync=true.",
